; Which WHO numbers a gateway forwards at all: status request *#W*31##, dimension request
; *#W*31*1##, command *W*1*31##.
; Boundary probe of 2026-11-16 and 2026-11-17 on the 13 emulated gateways: the same WHO values
; in all three forms, 0..40, 99, 100, 999..1030, 1099, 1100, 9999. The frames that at least one
; gateway does not answer at all are in who-forwarding-matrix-no-reply.
;
; Result (stock settings, two identical runs per target, 13 targets): per group below, the
; gateways that forward the frame to the bus or answer it on the event session, and the
; gateways whose daemon crashes. Gateways not named drop the frame.
;
; ORACLE ONLY: frames of this file crash a daemon on at least one emulated gateway; do not send
; them to a real gateway.

